// The route search's fastest runs of the first level (design.md, "The agent loop"): any% and
// 100%, tool-assisted, and the same with a human's limits, forgiving of a tick or two early or
// late (route/slack.wrela; route/tests.wrela checks them for it). `wrela tool route` searches
// for better ones and writes this file again, with the tests' times; run it again when a change
// to the movement moves them.

use course::course
use pad::{DOWN, Hold, JUMP, LEFT, PRESS, RIGHT, UP, hold}
use world::{LEVEL, play}

